        1256,
        1505,
        1373
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City has established and implemented procedures to secure meaningful M/WBE participation and is committed to making New York City a more equitable and inclusive business environment for all vendors, including M/WBEs, to operate; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
