    {
      "bbox": [
        196,
        1630,
        1505,
        1864
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. In consultation with the CBDO, each mayoral agency, as such term is defined in section 3301 of the New York City Charter, shall appoint an Agency Chief Contracting Diversity Officer who shall report directly to the agency head and consult with the CBDO on matters related to contracting with M/WBEs. Each agency head shall ensure that the Agency Chief Contracting Diversity Officer has the appropriate experience and is empowered to facilitate the agency meeting its M/WBE utilization goals.",
